# The image only needs the Rust crate. Keep build artifacts and the frontend
# out of the build context — the headless server uses none of it.
**/target
node_modules
.svelte-kit
build
.git
.context
static
src
*.md
# Read by `-f`, never needed inside the context — and while it sat there, every
# edit to it invalidated the COPY layer and rebuilt the world.
Dockerfile*
